; Enforce the engines.npm floor in package.json at install time. The committed
; package-lock.json must only ever be (re)written by npm >= 11 — an older npm
; hoists optional deps differently and writes a lock that CI's npm ci rejects
; (the 2026-07-16 @emnapi/core+runtime CI failure). Better a loud local install
; error than silent cross-machine lockfile drift.
engine-strict=true
